    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870220/extras/8d4ef18762dbd947fae857c91cedfdc9.avif?t=1750937505\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the essence of deckbuilding. Engage in tense 10-minute battles on a level playing field. Figure out a fun build from a unique set of cards and carefully evolve your deck into a well-oiled war machine. Don\u2019t copy decks, build on-the-fly and let your creativity shine. Every match is a new mind game! Beat the player, not the meta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this skill game you have a fair shot at the top spot, no matter the size of your collection. Climb the ranks fighting with weapons of equal strength. There is no pay-to-win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870220/extras/0150a33d43087a4b1d10702ed2d640cf.avif?t=1750937505\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skill in single-player missions that inspire your creativity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many expansion packs Tuggowar has to offer, discover new cards, abilities, extreme combos, crazy interactions and counter-plays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansion packs each feature 5 replayable missions with objectives of varying difficulty. These objectives help you find some of the more advances strategies. Some involve fixed steps while others are more puzzling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870220/extras/9a95c35d0be5f8f496c737451bb31d50.avif?t=1750937505\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit powerful card combos and commanding strategies. Analyze, think deep, experience glorious lightbulb moments, discover unknown synergies, test, adapt and outplay to pull off truly epic wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the ranks of veterans who keep coming back for more, even after hundreds of hours. Just one... more... game...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tInteractive map instead of a life total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tUnique draw system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tIntricate hidden information dynamics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tDisrupt to counter key card combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made for PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRanked &amp; casual modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPvP leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPlay a friend </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tMirrored shop mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRelaxed, normal and blitz game speeds </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill in PvE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Campaign missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSpecialized AI bots (easy, normal, hard, unfair)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tChallenge runs: 7 win mini-tournaments </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPause mid-game &amp; resume later</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-growing card pool</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t50 base set cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFrequent release of new expansion packs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New cards, new mechanics and new missions with each expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medal system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tInfluence the card pool used in a match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPlay with your favorite cards more often </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCollect medals and create your twist on the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRank up from bronze to diamond - and beyond</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCollectable avatars &amp; player titles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analyze and Show Off</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\t</strong>Hyperlink replay sharing &amp; spectator invites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tObserve live high-ranked matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tWeekly show matches - get your spectacular wins featured!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870220/extras/8d4ef18762dbd947fae857c91cedfdc9.avif?t=1750937505\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the essence of deckbuilding. Engage in tense 10-minute battles on a level playing field. Figure out a fun build from a unique set of cards and carefully evolve your deck into a well-oiled war machine. Don\u2019t copy decks, build on-the-fly and let your creativity shine. Every match is a new mind game! Beat the player, not the meta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this skill game you have a fair shot at the top spot, no matter the size of your collection. Climb the ranks fighting with weapons of equal strength. There is no pay-to-win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870220/extras/0150a33d43087a4b1d10702ed2d640cf.avif?t=1750937505\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your skill in single-player missions that inspire your creativity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many expansion packs Tuggowar has to offer, discover new cards, abilities, extreme combos, crazy interactions and counter-plays. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansion packs each feature 5 replayable missions with objectives of varying difficulty. These objectives help you find some of the more advances strategies. Some involve fixed steps while others are more puzzling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870220/extras/9a95c35d0be5f8f496c737451bb31d50.avif?t=1750937505\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit powerful card combos and commanding strategies. Analyze, think deep, experience glorious lightbulb moments, discover unknown synergies, test, adapt and outplay to pull off truly epic wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the ranks of veterans who keep coming back for more, even after hundreds of hours. Just one... more... game...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tInteractive map instead of a life total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tUnique draw system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tIntricate hidden information dynamics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tDisrupt to counter key card combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made for PvP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRanked &amp; casual modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPvP leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPlay a friend </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tMirrored shop mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRelaxed, normal and blitz game speeds </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill in PvE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Campaign missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSpecialized AI bots (easy, normal, hard, unfair)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tChallenge runs: 7 win mini-tournaments </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPause mid-game &amp; resume later</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-growing card pool</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t50 base set cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFrequent release of new expansion packs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New cards, new mechanics and new missions with each expansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medal system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tInfluence the card pool used in a match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPlay with your favorite cards more often </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCollect medals and create your twist on the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRank up from bronze to diamond - and beyond</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCollectable avatars &amp; player titles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analyze and Show Off</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022\t</strong>Hyperlink replay sharing &amp; spectator invites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tObserve live high-ranked matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tWeekly show matches - get your spectacular wins featured!</p>",
    "short_description": "Tuggowar is the big-brain deckbuilding duel. Engage in tense combat on a solarpunk frontier. Assemble your deck turn by turn, discover powerful card combos, disrupt the enemy strategy, and pilot your well-oiled war machine to victory!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
